SUMMARY:Portland Art Museum: Free First Thursday
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: FREE\nInfo: Explore the museum'
 s diverse collections for free. Tickets can be reserved online one week in
  advance or at the door. Often includes live DJs\, guided tours\, and spec
 ial programming. Part of Portland's First Thursday arts tradition.\nAddres
 s: 1219 SW Park Ave\, Portland\, OR 97205\nPhone: 503-226-2811\nWebsite: h
 ttps://portlandartmuseum.org/
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Arts &amp; Culture</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> FREE</p><p>Explore the museum&#x27;s diverse collections for free. Tickets can be reserved online one week in advance or at the door. Often includes live DJs, guided tours, and special programming. Part of Portland&#x27;s First Thursday arts tradition.</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> 1219 SW Park Ave, Portland, OR 97205</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-226-2811">503-226-2811</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://portlandartmuseum.org/">https://portlandartmuseum.org/</a></p></BODY></HTML>
