SUMMARY:Clackamas County Libraries (LINCC): Teen Advisory Group (GOAT)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: FREE\nEligibility: Grades 6-12\
 nInfo: Help shape library programs and services for teens. Meet other teen
 s who love the library.\nWebsite: https://lincc.org\nDetails: 13 public li
 braries in Clackamas County. Oak Lodge and Gladstone operated by the count
 y\; others are independent LINCC members.
