SUMMARY:Portland Book Festival
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: Main day Saturday\, November 7:
  general admission pass $20 in advance or $27 at the box office\; Arts for
  All $5 (Oregon Trail Card or SNAP ID)\; youth under 17 (or 18 with a high
  school ID) FREE\; veterans and active military FREE with ID. A wristband 
 is required for everyone. 14 Cover to Cover events around town\, November 
 2-8\, are labeled free.\nNote: Bring your Oregon Trail Card or SNAP ID for
  Arts for All. The festival's passes-and-tickets page has the current wris
 tband pickup details. The Umbrella All-Access passes are sold out.\nAddres
 s: Portland Art Museum\, 1219 SW Park Ave\, Portland\, OR 97205\nPhone: 50
 3-248-4335\nWebsite: https://pdxbookfest.org/\nDetails: Literary Arts' ann
 ual festival\, expanded to a week of events in 2026. Free for youth\; $5 t
 hrough Arts for All.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Arts &amp; Culture</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> Main day Saturday, November 7: general admission pass $20 in advance or $27 at the box office; Arts for All $5 (Oregon Trail Card or SNAP ID); youth under 17 (or 18 with a high school ID) FREE; veterans and active military FREE with ID. A wristband is required for everyone. 14 Cover to Cover events around town, November 2-8, are labeled free.</p><p><em>Bring your Oregon Trail Card or SNAP ID for Arts for All. The festival&#x27;s passes-and-tickets page has the current wristband pickup details. The Umbrella All-Access passes are sold out.</em></p><p><strong>Address:</strong> Portland Art Museum, 1219 SW Park Ave, Portland, OR 97205</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-248-4335">503-248-4335</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://pdxbookfest.org/">https://pdxbookfest.org/</a></p><p><strong>Details:</strong> Literary Arts&#x27; annual festival, expanded to a week of events in 2026. Free for youth; $5 through Arts for All.</p></BODY></HTML>
