SUMMARY:St. James Lutheran Church Jazz Vespers: St. James Monthly Jazz Vesp
 ers (2026-2027 Season)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: FREE (freewill offering)\nInfo:
  Featured guest artists join the Mike Horsfall Trio and cantor Della Simon
 e: Nov 15 Renato Caranto & Vince Frates (followed by Visual Artists' Group
  reception at 6pm)\; Dec 20 Marilyn Keller\; Jan 17 John Stowell\; Feb 21 
 Eddie Parente\; Mar 21 David Evans.\nAddress: St. James Lutheran Church\, 
 1315 SW Park Ave\, Portland\, OR 97201\nPhone: 503-227-2439\nWebsite: http
 s://www.stjamespdx.org/life/wm/jazz/\nDetails: Monthly live jazz vespers o
